<title>CANADA: CP completes bid for Quebec Central Rail.</title>
<headline>CP completes bid for Quebec Central Rail.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Pacific Railway Company (CPR) said on Friday that it completed its bid to acquire Quebec Central Railway Company.</p>
<p>At the termination of the offer on October 4, about 98.5 percent of the capital stock subject to the offer had been tendered, CPR said.</p>
<p>CPR said it will complete the compulsory acquisition of the remaining capital stock. Quebec Central will also redeem its First Mortgage Debenture Stock. CPR is a wholly owned unit of Canadian Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Montreal bureau (514) 985-2434</p>
</text>
